{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.016080604705990265,"c":1,"x":0.78768699657416863,"t":"Reading","y":0.097778152277603558,"w":0.079138189951578841},{"x":0.24279834215632889,"t":"The Desolenator: producing clean water","w":0.46502059936523432,"h":0.018943284509881253,"c":1,"y":0.14389534922346481},{"c":1,"x":0.12757200976319893,"h":0.017462404653236896,"t":"Travelling around Thailand in the 1990s, William Janssen was impressed with the","y":0.18021201410557242,"w":0.70987655639648439},{"w":0.70987655639648439,"c":1,"y":0.19758539480124815,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"basic rooftop solar heating systems that were on many homes, where energy from","x":0.12757200976001579},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"the sun was absorbed by a plate and then used to heat water for domestic use. Two","w":0.71193415323893228,"y":0.21643109529947469,"x":0.12757201792416253,"c":1},{"y":0.23191998953084569,"x":0.1275005145920528,"c":1,"t":"decades later Janssen developed that basic idea he saw in Southeast Asia into a","w":0.68532023111979168,"h":0.018876173470972257},{"y":0.25100094921962923,"w":0.55986373901367181,"c":1,"t":"portable device that uses the power from the sun to purify water.","h":0.019085705490921034,"x":0.12748954875410684},{"y":0.2790697672824054,"h":0.017455556507806946,"t":"The Desolenator operates as a mobile desalination unit that can take water from","w":0.69547322591145844,"c":1,"x":0.12757202891189129},{"h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1,"y":0.29651162829555355,"t":"different places, such as the sea, rivers, boreholes and rain, and purify it for human","w":0.71810699462890626,"x":0.12757201697171885},{"t":"consumption. It is particularly valuable in regions where natural groundwater","c":1,"h":0.018950132093665473,"x":0.12757202348885205,"w":0.67489710489908861,"y":0.31389870471663373},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"w":0.70987655639648439,"t":"reserves have been polluted, or where seawater is the only water source available.","c":1,"x":0.12551439653844085,"y":0.33274440521565374},{"y":0.36042402838373278,"t":"Janssen saw that there was a need for a sustainable way to clean water in both the","w":0.70781890869140629,"h":0.016029460129664885,"c":1,"x":0.12757202703076076},{"y":0.37632508870184767,"h":0.01914016489988235,"t":"developing and the developed countries when he moved to the United Arab Emirates","c":1,"x":0.1275720141646417,"w":0.73662551879882809},{"y":0.39534883704276513,"h":0.017489796673310853,"c":1,"w":0.71810699462890626,"t":"and saw large-scale water processing. 'I was confronted with the enormous carbon","x":0.12757201705531618},{"y":0.41279069783007261,"h":0.018895348053517669,"x":0.12551442082810874,"w":0.72016459147135425,"c":1,"t":"footprint that the Gulf nations have because of all of the desalination that they do,'"},{"h":0.01852785431734949,"y":0.43103617573422781,"x":0.12434035229725893,"w":0.078661346435546869,"t":"he says.","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.12752347441922532,"y":0.45780601240924379,"w":0.72026646931966154,"t":"The Desolenator can produce 15 litres of drinking water per day, enough to sustain","h":0.020108621729838516},{"x":0.12551439122755481,"w":0.68930043538411456,"t":"a family for cooking and drinking. Its main selling point is that unlike standard","c":1,"h":0.017448708362377219,"y":0.47673733830200682},{"w":0.73456792195638021,"x":0.12757200601974147,"t":"desalination techniques, it doesn't require a generated power supply: just sunlight. It","h":0.0175171886933847,"y":0.49411071843553178,"c":1},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.12757202421632532,"c":1,"y":0.51442873983445769,"t":"measures 120 cm by 90 cm, and is easy to transport, thanks to its two wheels. Water","w":0.72633743286132824},{"t":"enters through a pipe, and flows as a thin film between a sheet of double glazing and","w":0.73251027425130211,"h":0.017493220465202963,"x":0.12757202328381387,"c":1,"y":0.53197674402640116},{"y":0.5494186044916558,"h":0.017441860778592999,"x":0.12757201416515576,"t":"the surface of a solar panel, where it is heated by the sun. The warm water flows into","c":1,"w":0.73662551879882809},{"y":0.56831395334180934,"t":"a small boiler (heated by a solar-powered battery) where it is converted to steam.","x":0.12757201070030733,"w":0.70370371500651041,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1},{"y":0.58421672555990423,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"w":0.73251027425130211,"t":"When the steam cools, it becomes distilled water. The device has a very simple filter","x":0.12962963673073355},{"t":"to trap particles, and this can easily be shaken to remove them. There are two tubes","x":0.12551440287261822,"c":1,"y":0.60453474696732212,"h":0.017667844522968101,"w":0.72427983601888024},{"w":0.70164606730143231,"c":1,"x":0.12551441480607403,"t":"for liquid coming out: one for the waste - salt from seawater, fluoride, etc. - and","y":0.62209302309650305,"h":0.017482948527881015},{"t":"another for the distilled water. The performance of the unit is shown on an LCD","y":0.63752148513371376,"w":0.69563471476236971,"h":0.020424152010321106,"x":0.12749253355347842,"c":1},{"y":0.65694935235285667,"t":"screen and transmitted to the company which provides servicing when necessary.","x":0.12551442421352552,"c":1,"w":0.70987650553385417,"h":0.017469251675375497},{"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"A recent analysis found that at least two-thirds of the world's population lives","w":0.68724278767903646,"y":0.68459302309609926,"x":0.11522634267363505,"c":1},{"x":0.1275720226373617,"y":0.70347467621761051,"h":0.016002068109591039,"t":"with severe water scarcity for at least a month every year. Janssen says that by","c":1,"w":0.68106994628906259},{"x":0.12545015477401905,"y":0.7184019551070101,"t":"2030 half of the world's population will be living with water stress - where the","h":0.020795035839642484,"c":1,"w":0.68944844563802077},{"w":0.72839502970377601,"y":0.73691860485405525,"h":0.018970677091600718,"t":"demand exceeds the supply over a certain period of time. 'It is really important that","c":1,"x":0.1275720371645728},{"y":0.75436046472992935,"x":0.12757201940112195,"w":0.69135803222656256,"h":0.020374517137507264,"t":"a sustainable solution is brought to the market that is able to help these people,'","c":1},{"y":0.77470930216609213,"t":"he says. Many countriesidon't have the money for desalination plants, which are","x":0.12551441385605983,"h":0.017441860778592888,"w":0.70781890869140618,"c":1},{"w":0.71604939778645826,"h":0.016012340046912876,"t":"very expensive to build. They don't have the money to operate them, they are very","x":0.1275720088357962,"c":1,"y":0.79358068334897691},{"h":0.020114002295180677,"t":"maintenance intensive, and they don't have the money to buy the diesel to run the","x":0.1254587459419968,"y":0.80951182888134099,"w":0.71204722086588546,"c":1},{"y":0.82699192295754698,"x":0.12748084896875578,"h":0.01998354661310231,"w":0.43231852213541666,"c":1,"t":"desalination plants, so it is a really bad situation?"},{"w":0.026748971939086874,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.91569767420225345,"c":1,"t":"63","x":0.8415637855325141}],"h":3395}